  -h, --help               help for new
  -n, --name string        package name to declare; defaults to the directory
                           name
[0;1;39m
EXAMPLES[0m
  
# Create a manifest for the project in the current directory.

    $ tt new

# Name the package explicitly, when the directory is not named for it.

    $ tt new -n my-app

