=== tt package deps --help
Print the runtime dependencies of every product and the dev dependencies, each
with the version app.manifest.lock resolved it to. This is what the current
manifest declares — not what is installed on disk, which is what tt package list
reports. Nothing is resolved and no registry is contacted: the answer comes from
the manifest and the lock, so a lock that no longer matches the manifest is
reported as stale rather than silently re-resolved.

