=== tt package search --help
Search the rock servers for rocks whose name contains TERM, reporting every
version each server offers. Unlike resolution, which stops at the first server
that has a rock, a search asks all of them: the point is to see what exists.
Nothing is downloaded and nothing is written. A term nothing matches is not an
error.

[0;1;39mUSAGE[0m
  tt package search TERM [flags]

  tt package search TERM [flags]
