=== tt registry list --help
Print the effective rock-server list in resolution order, each server with the
layer it was configured in. The layers replace one another rather than merging:
the outermost one that names anything is the whole list, because resolution
takes the first server that has a rock and an appended server would change which
that is. Run in a project directory to see what its manifest configures.

